// PARAM: --analysis congruence --solver per-origin
// Exercises --solver per-origin with the Congruence domain. The registry
// publishes Congruence under join and per-origin only: its widen is plain
// join, and a strictly ascending chain of residue classes is a chain of
// proper divisors of the modulus, so join alone terminates and the two
// warrowing routes would solve the same system by the same steps -- both
// are rejected at the CLI with exit code 1, the way Solver_Warrow is for
// Sign (03-sign_per_origin.vimp).
void main() {
  x := 2 + 2;
  __voblint_check(x == 4) // PROVED
}
